+# World Bank WDI (CC BY 4.0). The API is called ONLY by `run_all.py --fetch` (src/01_ingest/fetch_worldbank.py); the analysis reads
+# the snapshot files named under `snapshots` below. Raw responses are saved unchanged; MANIFEST.csv records URL, time and SHA-256.
